WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.518
Day 8. Bigger beats.

2
00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:08.780
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:17.011
Some beats have two letters side by side, or a pair that makes one sound. Each beat is still a short word your child can read.

4
00:00:24.411 --> 00:00:25.643
The word is sandwich.

5
00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:34.532
The word is chipmunk.

6
00:00:35.432 --> 00:00:39.989
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

7
00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:44.962
Read the first row of job one together. Your child reads the second row.

8
00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:49.445
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

9
00:00:49.895 --> 00:00:54.623
Cover the second beat with a finger. Read the first one. Then uncover the rest.

10
00:00:55.423 --> 00:01:01.129
Job two is for your child alone. Read each word first. Then draw a line to its picture.

11
00:01:01.579 --> 00:01:05.919
The picture comes after the word. So the picture is the check, and not the clue.

12
00:01:06.369 --> 00:01:09.832
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
